  "description": "VIMNUC crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C60 H142 Dy8 N10 O36 4+,4(C1 F3 O3 S1 1-),3(C1 H4 O1),2(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy1D (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2D (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3D (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4D (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 15 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.562-4.471 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 93.98-138.16°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [DyIII8(OH)6(teaH)6(teaH2)2(teaH3)2](O3SCF3)4·0.5MeOH·2H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 6 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula). Article name explicitly identifies Dy(III).",
